5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about relying on conditions we cannot control, like weather or transport.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The location of our buildings dictates who can actually reach us, a quiet but heavy constraint.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Why do we judge new ideas by how they sound, ignoring records of similar past attempts?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Budgets often look fine on vote day but thin out by year two; the shape matters.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,We must check if staff actually have the skills for new commitments before promising them.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, yes, the timing of funding often breaks when external factors shift unexpectedly.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Rin, those old records are important, but the physical access barriers remain the primary hurdle.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Jonathan, access is key, but we need to see what worked before to avoid repeating mistakes.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, skill gaps are real, but the funding structure is what usually collapses first.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, I agree, but without the right people, even good funding fails to deliver.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look into winter road closures and attendance from former outreach stops.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I need to check bus links in outer wards and evening room bookings.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I want to see the two programmes begun six years ago and attendance sheets.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will investigate the county grant terms and the running and equipment lines.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will check the volunteer register and the neighbourhood associations and tool certification.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,Thank you all. Let us see what the data says about our reliability.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Quietly, I hope the access data clarifies the reach of any new service.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I am excited to see if the old records match the new proposals.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Let us hope the ledger tells the truth about the sustainability of these ideas.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,I will ensure we do not overpromise what our current team can handle.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
