35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The roads closed for eleven days, but the halls kept their timetables. That is a strong signal.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The bus links are gone in the outer wards. An hour's trip is a barrier no one should face.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The old digitisation project failed, but the evening groups still meet. Outreach works if supported.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The grant only covers sessions for a year. After that, the flat budget takes the hit.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minako,,"We have volunteers, but no one on payroll is trained to supervise them. That is a gap.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, if the bus is gone, a mobile service might be the only way to reach them.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, exactly. The fixed schedule of a mobile unit could bridge that hour-long gap.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Benjamin, the grant terms are tight, but the attendance numbers show real demand in the outer wards.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, demand is good, but the vehicle running costs overran by a third last year. That is a risk.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, the running costs are a concern, but the volunteer base for a workshop is already there.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"The mobile service seems to address the access issue directly, despite the road closures.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. The evening bookings are full, but the mobile unit can operate outside those hours.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"The maker workshop has tools, but the technician who certified them retired. That is a problem.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The language circles rely on the grant, which ends in a year. That is a cliff edge.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minako,,"The digital archive is a one-off cost, but the scanning contractors slip when big clients book.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"I am leaning towards the mobile service. It meets people where they are, safely.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,The mobile service fits the access data best. It is a logical next step.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,I support the mobile service. The attendance sheets prove the need is real and high.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I have concerns about the running costs, but the grant covers the first year. It is viable.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minako,,The mobile service uses existing staff skills. No new supervision training is needed immediately.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
